state: `gIOAllCPUInitializedKey` / `kIOAllCPUInitializedKey` have only
publishers (AppleARMSMP.cpp, SweetCPU.cpp) and the definition in IOService.cpp;
`ml_cpu_init_completed()` has only the two publishers plus scheduler-internal
